The files dinara_align/alignment.mojo, dinara_align/common.mojo and
dinara_align/errors.mojo are generated from AffineGaps' alignment.mojo,
common.mojo and errors.mojo by scripts/port_from_affinegaps.py, which records
every modification: the folding, cofolding, protein-scoring, Python-binding and
command-line code was removed, the sources were migrated to Mojo 1.1, and the device
specs query gained a branch for Apple GPUs, which Metal answers only in part.
dinara_align/api.mojo ports the dispatch logic of AffineGaps' affinegaps.mojo
from Python objects to native Mojo types.

dinara_align/edit_distance.mojo is ported from pa-bitpacking in A*PA
(https://github.com/RagnarGrootKoerkamp/astar-pairwise-aligner, commit
bf2e14e0cbc3a9a03600dcda0641d7f89e401e63), by Ragnar Groot Koerkamp and Pesho
Ivanov, and so remains under the Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0, as its
header states; the rest of this repository is Apache-2.0.

